window.TOEIC=[{"code":"14-1","title":"就醫預約與互動：醫療服務溝通 (Medical Appointments & Interactions)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-1 保健場景-就醫預約與互動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患致電醫療中心要求重新安排預約，並詢問牙科初診流程與診所延誤狀況。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解就醫與改期需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明就醫或改期需求，多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「來電目的（purpose）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, Riverside **Medical Center**. How may I **assist** you?","zh":"早上好，河濱醫療中心。請問有什麼我可以協助您的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Hi, I'm calling to **reschedule** my **physical therapy** session with Doctor Martinez. It's currently booked for 2 PM tomorrow, but something came up. Could I move it to later in the week?","zh":"嗨，我打電話是要重新安排與 Martinez 醫生的物理治療課程。目前預約在明天下午 2 點，但臨時有些事情。我可以把它改到本週晚些時候嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical center","pos":"n.","zh":"醫療中心、醫院","syn":"hospital = healthcare center = healthcare campus","tip":"解題技巧　聽力中聽到 Medical Center 代表此處為大型綜合醫療設施，規模大於一般的 clinic（診所）。","trap":""},{"w":"Assist","pos":"v.","zh":"協助、幫助","syn":"help = support = aid","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"change time = rearrange = move to another slot","tip":"","trap":"reschedule（改期）絕對不等於 cancel（取消）！多益聽力最愛考此動作混淆。"},{"w":"Physical therapy","pos":"n.","zh":"物理治療","syn":"physiotherapy = rehabilitation","tip":"解題技巧　Martinez 醫生在此處為物理治療專科醫生（specialist）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對病人資訊與詢問初診表格","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患基本資料與病歷號碼。多益常考新病人與舊病人的流程差異（如填寫表格要求）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Let me check the schedule. May I have your **patient ID** number?","zh":"讓我幫您查詢一下時間表。方便請教您的病歷號碼嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"It's 45782. Oh, and I'm also coming in today for my first appointment at your **dental clinic**. Do I need to fill out any forms?","zh":"號碼是 45782。喔，還有我今天也要去你們的牙科診所進行我的第一次看診。我需要填寫任何表格嗎？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Patient ID","pos":"n.","zh":"病歷號碼、病患識別碼","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，行政人員核對身分時，提供 ID number、policy number（保單號碼）或 name 是標準任務流程。","trap":""},{"w":"Dental clinic","pos":"n.","zh":"牙科診所","syn":"dentist office = dental practice","tip":"","trap":"多重預約計算：男士在同一天安排了「物理治療」與「牙科看診」，在多益中同日多重預約（Same-day multiple）在系統中算作兩個分開的預約時段，不可混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：物理治療改期與新病人填表要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排具體療程時程，並要求新病人提前完成必要的病史問卷（questionnaire）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, since you're a new dental patient, please complete the **medical history questionnaire** before you arrive. Now, for the physical therapy, I can **move** you to Thursday at 3 PM. Does that work?","zh":"是的，因為您是牙科的新病人，請在到達之前完成病史問卷。現在，關於物理治療，我可以將您移到週四下午 3 點。這樣可以嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Thursday's perfect. And what time should I come in today for the **dental appointment**?","zh":"週四太完美了。那我今天應該幾點來做牙科看診呢？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"New patient","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新病人、初診病患","syn":"first-time visitor = intake patient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病史問卷","syn":"registration forms = intake forms = health record","tip":"解題技巧　講義指出新病人流程的黃金考點為：「病史問卷必須在就診前完成 (before you arrive / before your visit)」。","trap":""},{"w":"Move","pos":"v.","zh":"移動、更改時間","syn":"postpone to = shift = reschedule","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dental appointment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"牙科預約","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　牙科服務包含 tooth cleaning (洗牙) 與 whitening procedure (美白療程)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：時間確認與診所延誤告知","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"告知診所目前的稍微延誤狀況（running behind），提醒可能晚開始，病患表示運作正常並配合。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Your dental appointment is at 11 AM, but we're **running behind** about 15 minutes this morning, so it may start a little late.","zh":"您的牙科看診時間是上午 11 點，但我們今天早上進度落後了大約 15 分鐘，所以可能會稍微晚一點開始。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's fine. I'll **head over** soon. Thank you.","zh":"沒關係。我很快就會過去。謝謝妳。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Running behind","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"進度落後、延誤","syn":"experiencing a slight delay = running late = 15 minutes later","tip":"","trap":"15 minutes late 只是輕微延誤 (slight delay)，並不等於診所關門 (clinic closed)！"},{"w":"Head over","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"前往、出發","syn":"go to = travel to = depart for","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本留言為診所接待員 Sarah 致電病患 Mr. Thompson，告知其預約醫師臨時有手術需要改期，並說明新病人填表與改期時程安排。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明身分與告知看診預約","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"表明診所身分與來電目的。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"Hello, Mr. Thompson. This is Sarah calling from **Greenfield Dental Clinic**. I'm calling about your **tooth cleaning** and **whitening appointment** scheduled for tomorrow with Doctor Lee.","zh":"你好，湯普森先生。我是格林菲爾德牙科診所的莎拉打來的。我打電話是關於您明天與李醫生預約的洗牙和美白療程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Greenfield Dental Clinic","pos":"n.","zh":"格林菲爾德牙科診所","syn":"dentist office = dental practice","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tooth cleaning","pos":"n.","zh":"洗牙","syn":"dental hygiene = teeth cleaning","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Whitening appointment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"美白預約","syn":"cosmetic dental booking","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知緊急手術需要改期","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出改期任務與突發原因（緊急手術）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"Unfortunately, Doctor Lee has been called in for an **emergency surgery**, so we'll need to **reschedule**.","zh":"不幸的是，李醫生臨時被召去進行一場緊急手術，所以我們需要重新安排時間。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Emergency surgery","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"緊急手術","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，醫生無法看診最常見的原因是 Doctor has emergency surgery（醫生有緊急手術），此為標準考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"change the date = find another time","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提供空檔時段與新病人填表要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供替代的預約時間（openings），並引導新病人（first visit）在看診前完成病史問卷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"We have two **openings** next month — the 15th at 10 AM or the 22nd at 2 PM. Also, since this will be your **first visit** to our clinic, please remember to complete the new patient **medical history questionnaire** before your appointment.","zh":"我們下個月有兩個空檔——15號上午10點或22號下午2點。另外，由於這是您第一次光臨我們的診所，請記得在預約前完成新病人病史問卷。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Openings","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"空檔、可預約的時段","syn":"available slots = vacancies","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"First visit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"第一次造訪、初診","syn":"first-time visitor = new patient","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病史問卷","syn":"health survey = intake form","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：線上填寫省時及回電確認","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導病患線上提前完成以節省現場時間，並要求撥打專線回覆。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Sarah","t":"You can fill it out on our Web site **ahead of time**, which will save you some time on the day of your visit. Please call us back at 555-0123 to let us know which date **works best** for you. Thank you.","zh":"您可以提前在我們的網站上填寫，這樣在您就診當天可以節省一些時間。請撥打 555-0123 回電給我們，讓我們知道哪個日期最適合您。謝謝。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Ahead of time","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"提前、預先","syn":"in advance = beforehand","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Works best","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"最合適、最方便","syn":"is most convenient = suits you best","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本通知為 Westside Medical Center 發送給病患 Sarah Mitchell 的預約確認與就診重要 Reminders 郵件。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：確認多重就醫預約","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明來信目的為確認即將到來的預約，並提供病歷號核對。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Dear Ms. Mitchell, Thank you for choosing **Westside Medical Center** for your healthcare needs. —[1]—. This email is to **confirm** your **upcoming** appointments and provide some important reminders.","zh":"親愛的米切爾女士，感謝您選擇西區醫療中心來滿足您的醫療需求。—[1]—。這封電子郵件旨在確認您即將到來的預約並提供一些重要提醒。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Westside Medical Center","pos":"n.","zh":"西區醫療中心","syn":"healthcare campus = hospital complex","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Confirm","pos":"v.","zh":"確認、證實","syn":"verify = validate","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Upcoming","pos":"adj.","zh":"即將到來的","syn":"approaching = scheduled","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：列舉同日及跨科室多重預約","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"列出同一天（March 25th）包含物理治療（physical therapy）與回診（follow-up）之多重時程安排。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Your **check-up** with Doctor Kumar is scheduled for March 25 at 10 AM. Following that, you have a **physical therapy evaluation** at our **rehabilitation clinic** at 2 PM the **same day**. —[2]—.","zh":"您與 Kumar 醫生的檢查安排在 3 月 25 日上午 10 點。隨後，您將於同一天下午 2 點在我們的康復診所進行物理治療評估。—[2]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Check-up","pos":"n.","zh":"身體檢查、例行檢查","syn":"routine examination = general visit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Physical therapy evaluation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"物理治療評估","syn":"physiotherapy assessment = rehab evaluation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Rehabilitation clinic","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"康復診所","syn":"rehab center = recovery facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Same day","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"同一天","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"同日多重預約：Mar 25 共有 10 AM 和 2 PM 兩次不同門診，這在系統中代表 two separate visits（兩次分開看診），會產生兩筆帳單與紀錄。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：專科回診與新病人線上填表","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明如果有後續治療需求，需撥打櫃台電話預約；同時提及 3 月 30 日的牙科預約為初診，必須在就診前填妥問卷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"If your **therapist** determines that additional sessions are needed, you can call our **receptionist** at 555-0180 with your patient ID to schedule a **follow-up**. You are also scheduled for a **tooth cleaning** at our dental clinic on March 30. Since this will be your first visit to our **dental department**, please complete the **new patient medical history questionnaire** before your appointment. The form is **available** on our Web site at www.westsidemedical.com/newpatient. —[3]—.","zh":"如果您的治療師確定需要額外的療程，您可以致電 555-0180 聯繫我們的接待員，並提供您的病歷號來安排回診。您還安排在 3 月 30 日在我們的牙科診所進行洗牙。由於這是您第一次造訪我們的牙科部，請在預約前完成新病人病史問卷。該表格可在我們的網站上（www.westsidemedical.com/newpatient）下載。—[3]—。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Therapist","pos":"n.","zh":"治療師","syn":"specialist = rehab expert","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Receptionist","pos":"n.","zh":"接待員、前台人員","syn":"front desk staff = clerk","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Follow-up","pos":"n./adj.","zh":"後續回診、跟進","syn":"subsequent visit = additional session","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Tooth cleaning","pos":"n.","zh":"洗牙","syn":"dental hygiene = teeth cleaning","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dental department","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"牙科部門","syn":"dentistry unit = dental office","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"New patient medical history questionnaire","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新病人病史問卷","syn":"intake health questionnaire = registration forms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Available","pos":"adj.","zh":"可獲得的、可用的","syn":"accessible = obtainable","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：提早到場辦理與48小時改期原則","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提醒病患提早到場（arrive 20 minutes before）完成現場文書，並訂立至少 48 小時改期的重要規定。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Westside Medical Center","t":"Please plan to **arrive 20 minutes before** each appointment to complete any remaining **paperwork** at the **front desk**. —[4]—. If you need to reschedule any of these appointments, we kindly ask that you provide at least **48 hours' notice**. We look forward to seeing you. Best regards, Westside Medical Center Appointments Team","zh":"請計劃在每次預約前 20 分鐘到達，以在前台完成任何剩餘的文書工作。—[4]—。如果您需要重新安排任何一項預約，我們懇請您至少提前 48 小時通知。我們期待與您見面。西區醫療中心預約團隊敬上"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive 20 minutes before","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提前20分鐘到達","syn":"arrive early = two-thirds of an hour early","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Paperwork","pos":"n.","zh":"文書工作、表格手續","syn":"forms = documents","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Front desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"前台、掛號櫃台","syn":"registration desk = reception","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"48 hours' notice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"48小時前通知","syn":"two days ahead = 48 hours early","tip":"解題技巧　取消或重新安排（cancel/reschedule）時，「提前48小時（two days ahead）」是醫療與牙科場景中的經典時程規定，務必牢記。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-2","title":"藥物與健康產品：藥房服務溝通 (Medication & Health Products)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-2 保健場景-藥物與健康產品.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現客戶 Jennifer Park 致電藥房，核對電子處方箋並詢問缺貨藥物特別訂購到貨時間與全天候專線諮詢服務。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解過敏藥物配藥需求","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明用藥需求，多益聽力 Part 3 常在此處考「來電目的（purpose）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Good afternoon, City **Pharmacy**. How can I help you?","zh":"下午好，城市藥房。請問有什麼我可以幫忙的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Hi, I'm calling about a **prescription**. My doctor's office told me they sent it over electronically this morning. I need a **refill** on my **allergy medication**.","zh":"嗨，我打電話是關於一份處方箋。我醫生的辦公室告訴我，他們今天早上已經電子傳送過去了。我需要補充我的過敏藥物。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pharmacy","pos":"n.","zh":"藥房、藥局","syn":"常與 medical office（診所）或 healthcare facility（醫療機構）等詞彙進行場景關聯。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription","pos":"n.","zh":"處方箋","syn":"在閱讀測驗中常代換為 Rx 或 doctor's order。","tip":"注意事項　指必須由醫生開立的配藥指示（needs doctor's order），藥房無權自行開立處方藥。","trap":""},{"w":"Refill","pos":"n.","zh":"(處方的) 重新調配、補充藥物","syn":"常與 replenishment 或 renewal 進行代換。","tip":"","trap":"多益聽力最愛考「需求混淆」，請牢記 refill 只是補充藥物，不等於新處方（refill ≠ new prescription）！只要還有補充次數，就不用重新看醫生。"},{"w":"Allergy medication","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"過敏藥物","syn":"allergy pills = antihistamine","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對資料與告知特定劑量缺貨","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認藥物成分規格，通常會出現「庫存不足、劑量或品牌不符」等任務阻礙，為 Part 3 必抓的細節。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Sure, let me look that up. What's your name?","zh":"好的，讓我查一下。請問您的名字是？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Jennifer Park.","zh":"珍妮佛·朴。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"OK, I do see your prescription here, Ms. Park. However, the **dosage** your doctor prescribed isn't something we currently have **in stock**.","zh":"好的，朴女士，我確實看到您的處方箋了。然而，您醫生開立的特定劑量目前我們店裡沒有現貨庫存。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Dosage","pos":"n.","zh":"劑量、服用量","syn":"常與 dose 或 amount 進行代換。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"In stock","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"有庫存、有現貨","syn":"在多益閱讀中常與 available（可得到的）或 on hand（手頭有的）互換。","tip":"反義詞　out of stock（缺貨，代換為 unavailable 或 need to order）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排特別訂購與非處方藥替代","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"安排取藥交付流程（如特別訂購與預估到貨日），或提供臨時的替代藥物，是聽力中高頻的「建議/行動題」落點。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"We'll need to order it, and it should **arrive by** Thursday.","zh":"我們需要另外訂購，而且它應該會在週四之前送達。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Thursday... that's two days from now. Is there anything I can take **in the meantime**? I've been having terrible symptoms.","zh":"週四...那是兩天後。這段等待期間有什麼我可以先服用的嗎？我一直有很嚴重的症狀。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"We do carry an **over-the-counter** antihistamine with similar effects.","zh":"我們確實有賣一種具類似效果的非處方抗組織胺藥。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Arrive by","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"在...前送達","syn":"常與 come by 或 get here by 互換。","tip":"","trap":"by Thursday 代表「不遲於週四 / 週四或之前」（no later than Thursday），絕對不等於週四當天（on Thursday）才到！此時間差是多益 Part 3 聽力的超級大重播地雷。"},{"w":"In the meantime","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在此期間、同時","syn":"常用於表示在等待預訂商品（order delivery）期間的過渡期，同義詞為 meanwhile。","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Over-the-counter","pos":"adj.","zh":"非處方的、成藥的 (簡稱 OTC)","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益極常考「藥物誤判陷阱」。處方藥（prescription）必須有醫生處方；而非處方藥（OTC）則可由客戶直接購買（directly purchase / alternative options），兩者購買條件完全不同。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導諮詢全天候專業服務專線","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認後續處理狀態，提供全天候諮詢服務（helpline）或由認證專家（certified staff）解答副作用（side effects），作為對話的圓滿收尾。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"But if you'd like more detailed information about **side effects** or interactions with other medications, I'd recommend calling our 24-hour pharmacy **helpline**. You'll be connected directly with a certified **pharmacist** who can advise you.","zh":"但是如果您想了解有關副作用或與其他藥物相互作用的更多詳細資訊，我建議撥打我們的 24 小時藥房諮詢專線。您會直接聯絡到一位合格的藥劑師來為您提供建議。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"OK, I'll do that. Thanks for your help.","zh":"好的，我會去做的。謝謝您的幫忙。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Side effects","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"副作用","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指藥物伴隨的主要療效以外的身體反應。","trap":""},{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"諮詢服務專線","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指藥房提供客戶緊急諮詢（urgent questions）與解答用藥疑慮的電話管道。","trap":""},{"w":"Pharmacist","pos":"n.","zh":"藥劑師","syn":"在聽力中屬於 certified pharmacy staff（認證藥房人員）。","tip":"","trap":"多益常設身分干擾，要聽清對話者是藥劑師（pharmacist）還是醫生（doctor），藥劑師可以調整用藥建議但不能開立全新處方。"}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本廣播為 MediCare 藥房店內重要服務與庫存更新公告，內容涵蓋月配處方領取、缺貨特定品牌週四到貨、維他命有效期提醒、止痛藥特價及 24 小時熱線服務。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告對象與告知月配處方已可領取","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"向來店顧客（shoppers）宣告月處方（monthly prescription）藥物補充（refills）已補貨，現在可以前來領取（collect）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Attention **shoppers**, this is your neighborhood MediCare Pharmacy with important updates. The pharmacy just received your **monthly prescription** from the hospital system, so customers waiting for refills can now **collect** them.","zh":"各位顧客請注意，這是您鄰近的 MediCare 藥房為您帶來的最新通知。藥房剛剛收到了您在醫院系統的每月配藥處方箋，因此等待藥物補充的顧客現在可以前來領取了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Shoppers","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"顧客、買手","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　聽力中一開頭出現 Attention shoppers 或 attention clients 代表這是零售或店內廣播（in-store announcement）。","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly prescription","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月配藥處方箋","syn":"routine Rx refills = recurring medicines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collect","pos":"v.","zh":"領取、收取","syn":"pick up = retrieve = get","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：報告多種過敏與季節藥物補貨狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認大批庫存已返店（back in stock），說明昨天貨運（shipment）帶來的最新狀況。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Our pharmacist reports that allergy pills and several medications are **back in stock** after yesterday's **shipment**.","zh":"我們的藥劑師報告，在昨天的貨運送達後，過敏藥和幾種常見藥物目前都已補齊庫存了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Back in stock","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"重新補足庫存","syn":"replenished = available on hand again","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Shipment","pos":"n.","zh":"運送之貨物、到貨","syn":"delivery = cargo supply","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：特殊劑量訂購、維他命檢查與止痛成藥特價","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"針對特殊劑量特定品牌安排週四到貨，提醒檢查維他命過期日，並宣傳折扣非處方藥（over-the-counter pain relief）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"However, we'll need to order that **specific brand**, which should **arrive by Thursday**, for certain prescriptions requiring special dosage forms. Please check **expiration dates** on all vitamins and **supplements** purchased before January. Our **medical supplies** section now offers over-the-counter pain relief at **discounted prices**.","zh":"然而，對於某些需要特殊劑型規格的處方，我們仍需要訂購那個特定品牌，預計會在週四前到貨。請檢查在一月份之前購買的所有維他命和營養補充品的有效期限。我們的醫療用品區現在正以優惠特價提供非處方的止痛藥物。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Specific brand","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"特定品牌","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益聽力中，若要拿特定品牌或特殊規格劑量，往往需要額外調貨，這是常見的任務要求（need to order）。","trap":""},{"w":"Arrive by Thursday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週四前送達","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"選項中常出現 on Thursday 作為時間錯配誘餌，請認準 by（在...之前）。"},{"w":"Expiration dates","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"有效期限","syn":"expiry dates = best-before dates","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Supplements","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"營養補充品","syn":"vitamins = dietary additives","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Medical supplies","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"醫療用品","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Discounted prices","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"優惠折扣價","syn":"on sale = reduced rates = promotional offers","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導諮詢全天候熱線與營業時間","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供 24 小時熱線（helpline）解答副作用與服藥疑問，並提醒晚上 8 點前至處方櫃台（prescription counter）可享快速服務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Remember, our 24-hour **helpline** connects you directly with **certified pharmacy staff** for questions about side effects or proper medication use. Visit our **prescription counter** **before 8 PM** today for faster service.","zh":"請記住，我們的 24 小時服務諮詢熱線可讓您直接與認證的藥房人員聯繫，以解答有關副作用或正確用藥的問題。今天請在晚上 8 點前造訪我們的處方配藥櫃台，以享受更快速的服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"諮詢服務熱線","syn":"support hotline = consultation line","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified pharmacy staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證藥劑工作人員","syn":"licensed pharmacists = qualified medical staff","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription counter","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"配藥櫃台","syn":"dispensing counter = Rx pickup area","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before 8 PM","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"晚上8點前","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為廣播中的時間截至限制，8 PM 後可能服務放慢或部分櫃台關閉。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本顧客告示為 Hillside Pharmacy 於 4 月 1 日發布之處方藥物配藥、週一專家門診與 24 小時熱線服務改善說明。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告配藥服務改善目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布藥房配藥服務（prescription services）已與醫院系統對接，推行全新自動化訂購流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Dear **Valued** Customers, We're improving our **prescription services** to better serve your healthcare needs. —[1]—. The pharmacy just received your monthly prescription from the hospital system, implementing our new **automated ordering process**.","zh":"親愛的尊貴客戶，我們正在改善我們的處方箋配藥服務，以更好地滿足您的醫療需求。—[1]—。藥房剛剛收到您來自醫院系統的每月處方箋，這代表我們開始實行全新的自動化訂購流程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Valued","pos":"adj.","zh":"尊貴的、受重視的","syn":"loyal = esteemed","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prescription services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"處方配藥服務","syn":"medicine dispensing = Rx fulfillment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated ordering process","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化訂購流程","syn":"computerized order system = automated fulfillment","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：週一延長專家諮詢與大批補貨狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"自下週一（Monday）起提供劑量調整與副作用延長諮詢（extended consultations），並確認大批季節性藥物與過敏藥已到貨。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Starting Monday, our pharmacist will be available for **extended consultations** about medication, **dosage adjustments**, and potential side effects. —[2]—. All **allergy pills** and **seasonal medications** are now in stock following our latest shipment. For supplements and vitamins, please **verify** expiration dates at our medical supplies counter.","zh":"從週一開始，我們的藥劑師將可為您提供有關藥物、劑量調整和潛在副作用的延長諮詢服務。—[2]—。在我們最新一批貨物送達後，所有的過敏藥物和季節性藥物目前都有現貨。對於補充品和維他命，請到我們的醫療用品櫃台核對有效期限。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extended consultations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"延長諮詢門診","syn":"longer advisory sessions = detailed specialist reviews","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dosage adjustments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"劑量調整","syn":"modifying dose amounts = dose correction","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Allergy pills","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"過敏藥、抗組織胺","syn":"allergy medication = antihistamines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Seasonal medications","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"季節性藥物","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　多益閱讀中常考「季節性商品或藥物（如花粉季、感冒季）」的大批補貨（in stock following latest shipment）。","trap":""},{"w":"Verify","pos":"v.","zh":"證實、核對","syn":"confirm = check = examine","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：特殊訂購週四到貨與提前 48 小時線上申請","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"特殊規格藥物可在週四前送達，並宣布一般補充藥物現在已可提前 48 小時線上提交。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"We'll need to **order** that specific brand, which should **arrive by Thursday**, for any specialized prescriptions not regularly stocked. —[3]—. This includes both prescription and over-the-counter medications. Refill requests can now be **submitted online** **48 hours in advance**.","zh":"對於任何非常備的特殊處方，我們仍需要訂購那個特定品牌，預計會在週四之前送達。—[3]—。這包括處方藥和非處方藥。重複配藥申請現在可以提前 48 小時在線上提交。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Order","pos":"v.","zh":"訂購、下訂","syn":"request = place an order","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Arrive by Thursday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週四前送達","syn":"Thursday or before = no later than Thursday","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Submitted online","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"線上提交","syn":"filed electronically = completed via the website","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"48 hours in advance","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"提前48小時","syn":"two days ahead = 48 hours early","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：24 小時熱線諮詢與保險給付卡核對","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導利用 24 小時專線諮詢，並提出最核心的要求——「必須核對保險給付資格（insurance verification）」，領藥時務必攜帶保險卡。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Hillside Pharmacy","t":"Our 24-hour **helpline** connects you directly with **certified pharmacy staff** for **urgent questions**. —[4]—. This service ensures you always have access to **professional advice** about your medications, including proper dosage and **storage instructions**. Please note: **Insurance coverage verification** is required for all prescription medications. Bring your updated insurance card when **collecting refills**.","zh":"我們的 24 小時服務諮詢熱線可讓您直接與認證藥房人員聯繫以處理緊急問題。—[4]—。此服務可確保您隨時獲得有關藥物的專業建議，包括正確的劑量和儲存說明。請注意：所有處方藥都需要進行保險給付範圍驗證。領取補充藥物時，請攜帶您最新的保險卡。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Helpline","pos":"n.","zh":"服務諮詢專線","syn":"support hotline = all-day advisory call","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified pharmacy staff","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證合格的藥房團隊","syn":"qualified professionals = licensed chemists","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Urgent questions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"緊急問題","syn":"pressing inquiries = emergencies","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Professional advice","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專業建議","syn":"expert counsel = specialist guidance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Storage instructions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"儲存說明","syn":"preservation guidelines = maintenance rules","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Insurance coverage verification","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保險給付範圍驗證","syn":"benefit check = insurance verification","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Collecting refills","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"領取補充藥物","syn":"picking up replenishment = retrieving Rx renewal","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-3","title":"健康管理與營養：飲食諮詢溝通 (Health Management & Nutrition)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-3 保健場景-健康管理與營養.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現客戶在健康中心赴營養師預約，諮詢如何改善精力水平，並探討減少加工食品與客製化營養計畫。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：赴營養師預約以提升精力","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶說明來到健康中心（wellness center）之目的為看營養師，希望透過飲食改善精力（energy levels）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, I'm here for my appointment with the **nutritionist**. I've been exploring different **meal plans** to improve my **energy levels**.","zh":"早上好，我是來赴約與營養師的面談。我一直在探索不同的飲食計畫，以提高我的精力水平。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Nutritionist","pos":"n.","zh":"營養師、營養專家","syn":"dietitian = nutrition expert = certified wellness expert","tip":"","trap":"營養師絕對不等於醫生 (nutritionist ≠ doctor)！多益極愛考「來訪者與什麼身分的人說話（Most likely speaking to a nutritionist）」，切勿選 doctor 或 surgeon。"},{"w":"Meal plans","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"飲食計畫","syn":"eating plans = diet programs","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Energy levels","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"精力水平、活力程度","syn":"vitality = stamina = energy units","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：健康中心介紹與確認個人化目標","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"接待人員歡迎客戶，介紹營養專家專長為依據「飲食限制（dietary restrictions）」打造個人化計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to our **wellness center**! Your nutritionist, Dr. Chen, will see you shortly. She specializes in creating **personalized nutrition plans** based on **dietary restrictions** and healthy lifestyle goals.","zh":"歡迎來到我們的健康中心！您的營養師陳醫生很快就會和您見面。她專注於根據飲食限制和健康生活方式目標來制定個人化營養計畫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Wellness center","pos":"n.","zh":"健康中心、養生會館","syn":"fitness & nutrition facility = lifestyle clinic","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personalized nutrition plans","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"個人化營養計畫","syn":"customized eating programs = tailored diet plans","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Dietary restrictions","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"飲食限制","syn":"eating constraints = food limitations","tip":"解題技巧　飲食限制在多益中通常指過敏（allergy）、全素（vegan/vegetarian）或無麩質（gluten-free）等特殊用餐條件。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：專家建議減少加工食品與引進有機天然食材","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶說明專家核心建議為「減少加工食品」，並表達對天然食材與有機選擇（organic options）的興趣。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! The specialist **recommended reducing** **processed foods** in my daily meals. I'm also interested in learning about **organic options** with natural ingredients.","zh":"太棒了！專家建議在我的日常飲食中減少加工食品。我也很有興趣了解配有天然成分的有機選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Recommended reducing","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"建議減少","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"reducing（減少）絕對不等於 eliminating / avoiding entirely（完全消除/完全避免）！多益極偏好此程度副詞/動詞的置換陷阱，請認準「減少 processed foods 攝取」即可。"},{"w":"Processed foods","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"加工食品","syn":"packaged foods = manufactured foods","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Organic options","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"有機選擇","syn":"chemical-free eating = natural food options","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：食物標籤閱讀與當天取得客製化計畫","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認諮詢項目包含食品標籤（food labels）與營養成分計算，並承諾「當天（today）」即可提供量身打造的健康計畫。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Dr. Chen can definitely help with that. She'll review **food labels** with you and calculate appropriate **calories**, **protein, fat, and sugar** intake for your diet.","zh":"陳醫生絕對能對此提供協助。她會與您一起審查食品標籤，並為您的飲食計算合適的卡路里、蛋白質、脂肪和糖分攝入量。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. Does the **wellness education session** include information about reading **nutrition facts**?","zh":"太完美了。健康教育課程中是否包含有關閱讀營養成分表的資訊？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, our wellness center offers **personalized consultations** with **certified nutrition experts** who cover all aspects of healthy eating. You'll receive a **customized plan today**.","zh":"是的，我們的健康中心提供與認證營養專家的個人化諮詢，內容涵蓋健康飲食的各個層面。您今天就會收到一份為您量身定制的客製化計畫。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Food labels / Nutrition facts","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"食品標籤、營養成分表","syn":"nutrition facts label = caloric content table","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Calories, protein, fat, sugar","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"卡路里、蛋白質、脂肪、糖分","syn":"energy units, muscle-building nutrients, lipids, sweeteners","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wellness education session","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康教育課程","syn":"lifestyle coaching = diet seminar","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personalized consultations","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"個人化諮詢","syn":"individual sessions = dietitian consultation","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Certified nutrition experts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"認證營養專家","syn":"qualified dietitians = registered experts","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customized plan today","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"當天取得客製化計畫","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"today（今天/當天） ➔ 絕對不是 next week（下週）！多益聽力中常考「什麼時候可以拿到計畫（When will she receive the plan?）」，答案是 today（同一天）。"}]}]},{"code":"14-4","title":"醫療行政與設施：保險理賠與系統管理 (Medical Administration & Facilities)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-4 保健場景-醫療行政與設施.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患因醫療部分負擔金額有誤致電查詢，櫃台人員協助核對病歷並核准全額給付理賠，並提醒更新電子病歷檔案。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：發現帳單部分負擔金額有誤","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶來電表明帳單有錯誤（billing error），部分負擔金額（copayment amount）似乎有偏差。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good afternoon, I'm calling about my **billing statement**. There seems to be an error with my **copayment** amount.","zh":"下午好，我打電話是詢問我的費用帳單。我的部分負擔金額似乎有錯誤。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Billing statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"帳單、費用對帳單","syn":"invoice = bill","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Copayment","pos":"n.","zh":"(保險) 部分負擔金額、掛號費","syn":"copay = partial payment","tip":"解題技巧　部分負擔指的是病患看診時「每次需要自己固定支付的小額費用（Fixed per-visit fee）」，並非總額。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對基本資料與查詢病歷狀態","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"行政人員在數位系統中核對病患資料（patient data）與保單，確認保險已批准給付。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Let me check your **medical records** in our **digital system**. Can you provide your **patient data** and insurance information?","zh":"讓我在我們的數位系統中查看您的病歷。您能提供您的病患資料和保險資訊嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Sure. My **policy number** is 789456. Your insurance has **approved coverage** for the upcoming procedure, according to the letter I received.","zh":"當然可以。我的保單號碼是 789456。根據我收到的信件，您的保險已經核准了即將進行的醫療給付範圍。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical records","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"病歷、醫療紀錄","syn":"health records = medical background","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Digital system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位系統","syn":"digitized platform = electronic system","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Patient data","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"病患資料","syn":"personal file = patient record","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Policy number","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保單號碼","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Approved coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"核准保險給付範圍","syn":"authorized benefits = approved insurance coverage","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：確認已達自付額標準並更新電子病歷平台","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認病患年度自付額已達標（deductible met），理賠（claim）將全額給付，引導客戶在線上更新同意書（consent form）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I see that here. The deductible was already met, so your **claim** should be fully covered. Please update your information in our **electronic health record platform** to ensure accurate billing.","zh":"我看到了。您的年度自付額已經達到了標準，所以您的理賠申請應該會獲得全額給付。請在我們的電子健康記錄平台更新您的資訊，以確保帳單計費準確。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"I submitted the **consent form** and updated my medical history last week. When will I receive the **corrected statement**?","zh":"我上週已經提交了同意書並更新了我的病史。我什麼時候會收到修改正確的對帳單呢？"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Deductible","pos":"n.","zh":"(保險) 年度自付額門檻","syn":"out-of-pocket threshold","tip":"","trap":"copayment（每次看診付的部分負擔） ≠ deductible（年度需要累計達到的自付額門檻） ≠ total bill（全額帳單）！這三個概念是多益閱讀 Part 7 保險對照題中極核心的雷區。"},{"w":"Claim","pos":"n.","zh":"保險理賠申請","syn":"reimbursement request = insurance filing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Electronic health record platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子健康記錄平台","syn":"electronic platform = patient portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Consent form","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"(醫療) 同意書","syn":"release form = authorization document","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corrected statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"修改正確之費用對帳單","syn":"revised bill = adjusted invoice","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：承諾三個工作日內寄出與全新硬體設施效益","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認正確帳單將在「三個工作日（three business days）」內寄出，並宣傳新翻修設施（newly renovated facility）處理高效率。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Our **medical office** will send it **within three business days**. Our **newly renovated facility** incorporates the latest patient care technology, so all lab results and documents are processed faster now. The **hospital complex** billing department will also send a confirmation.","zh":"我們的醫療診所將會在三個工作日內寄出。我們新裝修的設施融入了最新的病患照護技術，因此現在所有的檢驗結果和文件處理都更為快速。醫院綜合大樓的帳務部門也會發送一份確認信。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Medical office","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"醫療診所","syn":"clinic = healthcare facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Within three business days","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在三個工作日內","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　工作日（business days）不含週末（weekends）。如果週五下午打電話，三天內代表最晚下週三寄出。","trap":""},{"w":"Newly renovated facility","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"新裝修/翻新設施","syn":"modernized facility = upgraded clinic = refurbished campus","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Hospital complex","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"醫院綜合大樓","syn":"medical center = healthcare campus","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本廣播為醫療診所向就診病患播報本週末進行數位系統升級更新，取消紙本表單，全面改用電子健康平台及掛號櫃台求助指引。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：公告本週末系統更新","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"通知病患診所將在「本週末（this weekend）」進行患者數據管理系統升級（upgrading），要求下次就診前在電子健康平台更新資訊。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Attention patients visiting our medical office. We're **upgrading** our patient data management system **this weekend**. Please update your information in our **electronic health record platform** **before your next visit**.","zh":"各位造訪我們診所的患者請注意。我們將在本週末升級我們的患者數據管理系統。請在您下一次就診前，先在我們的電子健康記錄平台上更新您的個人資訊。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upgrading","pos":"v.","zh":"升級、更新","syn":"updating = modernizing","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"This weekend","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"本週末","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"this weekend（本週末） ➔ 絕對不是 next month（下個月）！多益最愛考系統是在何時進行轉型升級。"},{"w":"Electronic health record platform","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子健康記錄平台","syn":"patient database portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Before your next visit","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"在您下次就診前","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為時程上規定的動作，要求患者在來店前完成線上更新。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：數位化轉型之流程簡化效益","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明新數位系統（digital system）的目的為簡化病歷、對帳單與理賠處理流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"This **digital system** will **streamline** medical records, billing statements, and insurance claims processing.","zh":"此數位系統將會簡化您的病歷檔案、費用帳單以及保險理賠的處理程序。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Digital system","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"數位化系統","syn":"digitized records = electronic software","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Streamline","pos":"v.","zh":"簡化、使效率化","syn":"simplify = optimize = make highly efficient","tip":"解題技巧　streamline 是一個在多益商務、物流及醫療行政管理中極高頻出現的黃金單字，指「透過取消繁雜步驟來提高效率（improve efficiency）」。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：即時通知、翻新硬體與取消紙本表單","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"新系統亮點為即時傳送通知，融入最新技術，且醫院大樓將徹底取消（eliminated）紙本病史表，全部改為線上驗證核對。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Your insurance has **approved coverage** for the upcoming procedure - such notifications will now arrive **instantly** through our **portal**. Our newly renovated facility **incorporates** the latest patient care technology, including **automated lab results delivery** and electronic consent forms. The hospital complex has **eliminated** paper medical history forms. All health insurance information, including copayments, deductibles, and coverage details, will be **accessible online**. Patients must **verify** their insurance data to ensure **accurate claim processing**.","zh":"您的保險已核准即將進行的醫療給付——此類通知現在將會即時發送到我們的入口網站中。我們全新裝修的設施融合了最新的病患照護技術，包括自動化檢驗結果傳送和電子同意書。本醫院綜合大樓已取消了紙本病史表格。所有的健康保險資訊，包括部分負擔、自付額以及給付範圍細節，都可在線上查詢。病患必須核對其保險資料，以確保理賠處理的準確性。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Approved coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"核准保險給付","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Instantly","pos":"adv.","zh":"即時地、立刻地","syn":"immediately = without delay","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Portal","pos":"n.","zh":"入口網站、門戶網站","syn":"online system = patient database","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Incorporates","pos":"v.","zh":"融入、整合","syn":"integrates = includes = combines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Automated lab results delivery","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動化檢驗結果傳送","syn":"computerized test result transit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eliminated","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"取消的、根除的","syn":"cancelled = removed = discontinued","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Accessible online","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"線上可查詢的/可存取的","syn":"digitally available = attainable on website","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Verify","pos":"v.","zh":"驗證、核對","syn":"check = confirm","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：引導至掛號櫃台求助與病患隱私承諾","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"引導需要協助的患者前往掛號櫃台（registration desk），並重申病患隱私與資料安全為第一首要任務（top priority）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Broadcaster","t":"Visit the **registration desk** for assistance with the new system. Remember, protecting your patient data remains our **top priority**.","zh":"若需要新系統的協助，請前往掛號櫃台。請記住，保護您的病患資料始終是我們的首要任務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Registration desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"掛號櫃台、報到櫃台","syn":"front desk = reception counter","tip":"","trap":"地點與職責對應：尋求新系統協助或提交同意書是在掛號櫃台 (registration desk) ➔ 絕對不是處理費用的 帳務部門 (billing department)！"},{"w":"Top priority","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"最首要任務、最高優先","syn":"most important concern = primary focus = chief objective","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"14-5","title":"健身與健康活動：會員服務與健康計畫 (Fitness & Health Activities)","ch":"Chapter 14　保健與醫療","sec":"五大情境單元（Ch14-1 ～ Ch14-5）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch14-5 保健場景-健身與健康活動.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話 (Brief Dialogue)","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"p","t":"本對話呈現病患前往健身中心，諮詢企業會員方案與每週150分鐘運動要求以符合保險給付，並詢問二樓瑜伽課程。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解健康計畫與會員選擇","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"病患至 Premier Fitness Center 詢問健康計畫（wellness program）與會員資格（membership）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Welcome to Premier **Fitness Center**! Are you interested in our **membership options**?","zh":"歡迎來到卓越健身中心！您對我們的會員選項有興趣嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, I'd like to know about your **wellness program** and fitness classes.","zh":"是的，我想了解你們的健康計畫和健身課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Fitness center","pos":"n.","zh":"健身中心","syn":"gym = workout facility","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Membership options","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"會員選項、會員資格","syn":"enrollment packages = subscription options","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Wellness program","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康計畫、養生專案","syn":"health initiative = fitness program","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：每週150分鐘運動保險要求細節","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認此健康計畫之核心參與規定為「每週150分鐘活動量」，並提供重訓、瑜伽與復健（rehabilitation）等多樣服務。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"The program requires participants to complete 150 minutes of activity weekly, right?","zh":"該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，對嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's correct. Join today and enjoy **unlimited use** of all our equipment and classes. We offer **yoga, aerobics, and strength training**. Personal training and **rehabilitation services** are also available.","zh":"沒錯。今天加入即可無限使用我們所有的器材和課程。我們提供瑜伽、有氧運動和重量訓練。同時也提供私人訓練和康復理療服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"150 minutes weekly","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週150分鐘","syn":"two and a half hours a week = 2.5 hours weekly","tip":"","trap":"多益閱讀 Part 7 喜歡考轉換計算，150 minutes = two and a half hours，千萬不要被 120 minutes (2 hours) 或 180 minutes (3 hours) 誤導！"},{"w":"Unlimited use","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限使用","syn":"unrestricted entry = full access","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Yoga, aerobics, strength training","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"瑜伽、有氧、重訓","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Rehabilitation services","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"復健理療服務","syn":"recovery services = rehab physical therapy","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：詢問二樓瑜伽課與下週健康博覽會推廣","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認早晨課程安排於二樓（second floor）主教室，並宣傳下週有健康博覽會（health fair）提供免費健康評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Great! When does the **morning yoga class** start?","zh":"太棒了！早上的瑜伽課幾點開始？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"My morning session starts at **7:30** in the **main studio** on the **second floor**. We're also hosting a **health fair** next week where you can get a **free wellness assessment** and try different workout routines.","zh":"我的晨間課程在 7 點 30 分開始，地點在二樓的主教室。我們下週還將舉辦一場健康博覽會，您可以在那裡獲得免費的健康評估，並嘗試不同的運動項目。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Morning yoga class / session","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"晨間瑜伽課","syn":"AM class = early workout","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"7:30","pos":"n.","zh":"早上7點30分","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　注意 AM/PM 的時間區隔，7:30 AM 為早晨看診/上課高峰。","trap":""},{"w":"Main studio","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"主教室","syn":"exercise room = classroom","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Second floor","pos":"n.","zh":"二樓","syn":"level 2 = upstairs","tip":"","trap":"活動在二樓 (second floor / level 2 / upstairs) ➔ 絕對不是 一樓 (first floor / level 1 / downstairs)！"},{"w":"Health fair","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康博覽會","syn":"health exhibition = wellness event","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Free wellness assessment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"免費健康評估","syn":"complimentary health check = free evaluation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：器材全免與現場填表申請加入","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認不需要自備運動器材（gym provides everything），病患決定當天填表加入。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Perfect. Do I need to bring my own **exercise equipment**?","zh":"太完美了。我需要自備運動器材嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"No, the **gym provides everything**. Just complete your **membership application** and you can start today.","zh":"不需要，健身房提供所有器材。只需填寫您的會員申請表，您今天就可以開始了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Exercise equipment","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"運動器材、健身設備","syn":"workout gear = exercise machines","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Gym provides everything","pos":"clause","zh":"健身房提供所有東西","syn":"all facilities included = complimentary amenities","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Membership application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"會員申請表","syn":"enrollment form = registration sheet","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白 (Brief Monologue)","ic":"📢"},{"k":"p","t":"本公告為健身中心經理向會員播報月底加入之無限使用特別優惠，說明新健康計畫下週一啟動，以及每週150分鐘的復健給付門檻。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布月底前加入無限使用特別優惠","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布本月底截止的特別優惠：今天加入即可無限使用（unlimited use）所有器材與課程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"Good morning, members! This is your **fitness center manager** with exciting updates. Join today and enjoy **unlimited use** of all our equipment and classes - this special offer extends through **month-end**.","zh":"會員們早上好！這是您的健身中心經理為您帶來的興奮好消息。今天加入即可享受我們所有設備和課程的無限使用——此項特別優惠將一直持續到月底。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Fitness center manager","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健身中心經理","syn":"gym supervisor = club director","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Unlimited use","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限使用權","syn":"full access = unrestricted entry","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Month-end","pos":"n.","zh":"月底","syn":"end of the month = closing of current cycle","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：週一推出新健康計畫與每週150分鐘運動要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布新健康計畫將在「週一啟動（launches Monday）」，並強調復健給付之每週 150 分鐘運動時數門檻。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"Our new wellness program **launches Monday**, featuring expanded fitness classes including yoga, aerobics, and strength training. The program requires participants to complete 150 minutes of activity weekly to qualify for **rehabilitation services coverage**.","zh":"我們全新的健康計畫將於下週一啟動，提供包括瑜伽、有氧運動和重量訓練在內的多樣化健身課程。該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，以符合康復理療服務的保險給付資格。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Launches Monday","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"週一推出/啟動","syn":"commences next Monday = starts early next week","tip":"","trap":"Monday launch（週一啟動健康計畫） ➔ 絕對不是 Saturday fair（下週六博覽會）！兩大活動時間點各異，注意混淆。"},{"w":"Rehabilitation services coverage","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"復健服務保險給付","syn":"rehab therapy insurance benefit","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：二樓主教室晨間課與下週六博覽會","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"晨間課程 7:30 在二樓主教室上課，下週六（Next Saturday）將舉辦健康博覽會，現有會員享有優先預約權。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"My morning session starts at **7:30 in the main studio on the second floor**, and I'll be leading **personal training demonstrations**. Next Saturday's health fair will **showcase** our exercise equipment and offer free wellness assessments. **Current membership holders** receive **priority booking** for all workout sessions.","zh":"我的晨間課程於 7 點 30 分在二樓主教室開始，我將親自帶領私人教練示範。下週六的健康博覽會將展示我們的運動器材並提供免費的健康評估。現有的會員可以享有所有健身時段的優先預約權。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"7:30 in the main studio on the second floor","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7點30分在二樓主教室","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　二樓在英文中除了 second floor，也常被代換為 upstairs 或是 level 2。","trap":""},{"w":"Showcase","pos":"v.","zh":"展示、展示陳列","syn":"display = exhibit = demonstrate","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Current membership holders","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"現有會員","syn":"active members = enrolled clients","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Priority booking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"優先預約權","syn":"preferential scheduling = advance reservation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：延長營業時間與前台登記","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣佈延長營業時間（extend hours）以應對增加之需求，並引導病患至前台（front desk）登記排程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Manager","t":"The gym will **extend hours** to **accommodate increased demand**. **Register** at the **front desk** for your preferred fitness class schedule.","zh":"健身房將延長營業時間以應對日益增長的需求。請到前台登記您偏好的健身課程時間表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Extend hours","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"延長營業時間","syn":"longer operating hours = open later","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Accommodate increased demand","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"容納/應對增長之需求","syn":"meet growing customer needs = handle larger attendance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Register","pos":"v.","zh":"登記、註冊","syn":"sign up = enroll","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Front desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"前台、服務台","syn":"registration desk = reception counter","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解 (Reading Passage)","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"p","t":"本備忘錄為 Human Resources（人資部門）發布給全體員工之 Elite Fitness Center 企業健康計畫合作 launch 及相關福利。"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布與健身中心建立夥伴關係","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布與 Elite 建立夥伴關係（partnership），提供全套企業健康計畫（corporate membership），加入即可享有無限使用福利。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"Dear Team, We're excited to announce our **partnership** with Elite Fitness Center to provide **comprehensive wellness benefits**. —[1]—. Join today and enjoy unlimited use of all our equipment and classes through this **corporate membership**.","zh":"親愛的團隊成員，我們非常高興地宣布我們與 Elite 健身中心建立了合作夥伴關係，為大家提供全面的健康福利。—[1]—。今天加入，即可透過此企業會員方案無限使用其所有的器材和課程。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Partnership","pos":"n.","zh":"合作夥伴關係","syn":"collaboration = alliance = strategic agreement","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Comprehensive wellness benefits","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"全面健康福利","syn":"all-inclusive fitness perks = overall health incentives","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corporate membership","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業會員資格","syn":"company-sponsored subscription = employer-paid plan","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：計畫涵蓋範圍與每週150分鐘保險折扣要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"計畫包含瑜伽、有氧、重訓及復健理療。強調每週運動必須滿 150 分鐘以維持健康保險折扣資格。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"The wellness program includes **access** to their gym, fitness classes, and **personal training services**. —[2]—. Available options include yoga, aerobics, strength training, and **specialized rehabilitation services**. The program requires participants to complete **150 minutes of activity weekly** to **maintain eligibility** for **health insurance discounts**.","zh":"此健康計畫包括使用他們的健身房、健身課程以及私人教練服務。—[2]—。可選的項目包括瑜伽、有氧運動、重量訓練和專業的康復理療服務。該計畫要求參與者每週完成 150 分鐘的活動，以維持其健康保險折扣的資格。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Access","pos":"n./v.","zh":"使用權、進入","syn":"entry = permission to use","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Personal training services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"私人訓練教練服務","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Specialized rehabilitation services","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"專業康復理療服務","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"150 minutes of activity weekly","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每週150分鐘運動要求","syn":"two and a half hours each week","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Maintain eligibility","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"維持符合資格","syn":"keep the qualification = remain eligible","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Health insurance discounts","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保費折扣優惠","syn":"premium reductions = insurance rate benefits","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：二樓晨間課與每月評估出席追蹤","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"每週二週四（Tuesday and Thursday）早上 7:30 晨間課程於二樓主教室上課，將進行出席率追蹤（track attendance）與每月健康評估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"My morning session starts at 7:30 in the main studio on the second floor - I'll be there as your **wellness coordinator** **every Tuesday and Thursday**. —[3]—. The fitness center will **track your workout attendance** and provide **monthly wellness assessments** to monitor progress.","zh":"我的晨間課程在 7 點 30 分於二樓主教室開始——每週二和週四我都會在那裡擔任大家的健康協調員。—[3]—。健身中心將會追蹤您的健身出席率，並提供每月的健康評估來監控進度。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Wellness coordinator","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"健康協調員","syn":"health supervisor = program administrator","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Every Tuesday and Thursday","pos":"adv. phr.","zh":"每週二與週四","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為固定的二日制（bi-weekly）排班，也是常考的時間考點。","trap":""},{"w":"Track your workout attendance","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"追蹤健身出席率","syn":"monitor class participation = record attendance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly wellness assessments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月健康評估","syn":"recurring fitness evaluation = monthly progress checks","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：6月20日博覽會與7月1日福利生效企業代碼","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布 6 月 20 日將舉辦健康博覽會（health fair），福利於 7 月 1 日全面生效（full benefits starting July 1st），員工可向人資（HR）取得專屬企業代碼（corporate code）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"HR Dept","t":"**A health fair on June 20th** will introduce all exercise equipment and available services. —[4]—. Membership registration begins immediately, with **full benefits starting July 1st**. Contact HR for your **corporate membership code** and fitness class schedule.","zh":"6 月 20 日的健康博覽會將會介紹所有的運動器材和可用的服務。—[4]—。會員資格註冊即刻開始，完整福利將於 7 月 1 日全面啟動。請聯繫人資部門取得您的企業會員專屬代碼和健身課程時間表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"A health fair on June 20th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"6月20日健康博覽會","syn":"","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Full benefits starting July 1st","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"7月1日福利生效","syn":"effective date July 1st = launching July 1","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Corporate membership code","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業會員專屬代碼","syn":"company-specific discount code = access code","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-1","title":"銀行與個人理財：申請與服務 (Banking & Personal Finance: Applications & Services)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-1 財務預算場景-銀行與個人理財.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：就醫/銀行貸款審理實戰對白","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解貸款申請狀態與開場詢問","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶致電銀行詢問先前提交的貸款申請處理狀態，考點在於「來電目的（purpose）」之定位。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, First National Bank. How may I **assist** you?","zh":"早上好，第一國家銀行。請問有什麼我可以協助您的嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Hi, I submitted a **loan application** last week, and I was told it would take about **five business days** to process. I'm calling to check whether there's been a decision.","zh":"嗨，我上週提交了一份貸款申請，當時被告知大約需要五個工作天來處理。我打電話來是想確認是否已經有了決定。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Assist","pos":"v.","zh":"協助、幫助","syn":"help = support = serve","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Loan application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"貸款申請","syn":"funding request = credit request","tip":"注意事項　在多益銀行場景中，loan (貸款) 申請是超級高頻主題，要與 credit card application (信用卡申請) 或 savings account upgrade (儲蓄帳戶升級) 進行區隔。","trap":""},{"w":"Five business days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"五個工作天","syn":"one week (因為扣除週末兩天，5個工作天即為一週) = 5 working days","tip":"","trap":"工作天 (business days) 僅包含週一至週五，不含國定假日與週末。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：核對客戶基本資料","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"銀行行員核對客戶姓名等基本資訊，以在系統中調出帳戶資料，屬於行政核對流程。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Sure, let me pull up your account. May I have your name, please?","zh":"好的，讓我調出您的帳戶。請問能給我您的名字嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"David Chen.","zh":"大衛·陳。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pull up","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"調出 (資料)、拉出 (檔案)","syn":"retrieve = access = search the system","tip":"注意事項　在客服或臨櫃場景中，常用於指在電腦系統中輸入關鍵字以「搜尋並顯示（display）」客戶的帳戶或預約資訊。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：告知批准結果、利率與款項發放","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"告知貸款申請已獲批准（approved），並說明關鍵的「年利率（interest rate）」與「入帳時程（deposit timeline）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Thank you, Mr. Chen. Yes, your application was **approved** yesterday. The **annual interest rate** on your loan is **4.5 percent**, and the funds should be **deposited** into your account within **two business days**.","zh":"謝謝您，陳先生。是的，您的申請昨天已經獲得批准。您的貸款年利率為 4.5%，款項應該會在兩個工作天內存入您的帳戶。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Approved","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"已批准、通過的","syn":"authorized = accepted = granted","tip":"注意事項　approve 的名詞形式為 approval (批准、同意)。","trap":""},{"w":"Annual interest rate","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"年利率","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　annual (年度的) + interest (利息/利潤) + rate (比率)","trap":""},{"w":"Deposited","pos":"v.","zh":"存入 (款項)","syn":"transferred into = credited to","tip":"反義詞　withdraw (提領、取款)。","trap":""},{"w":"Two business days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"兩個工作天","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　對應時間差考題。「昨天 (yesterday) 批准，加兩個工作天入帳」，代表從批准日起48小時內款項會到位。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：詢問提款手續費與說明收費政策","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認最終手續費細節，考查「自家分行免費，跨行每筆交易收取 3 美元手續費（$3 fee per transaction at other banks）」的費用對比。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's great news. I do have one more question — I'll probably need to **withdraw cash** fairly often. Are there any fees I should know about?","zh":"這真是太棒的消息。我還有一個問題——我可能需要相當頻繁地提領現金。有任何我應該知道的手續費嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Withdrawals from any of our **branch ATMs** are completely free. However, if you use **another bank's ATM**, there's a **3-dollar fee per transaction**. You'll be able to see all the details on your **monthly statement**.","zh":"從我們任何分行的提款機（ATM）提款都是完全免費的。然而，如果您使用其他銀行的提款機，每筆交易將收取 3 美元的手續費。您將能在您的每月對帳單上看到所有細節。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Good to know. Thanks for your help.","zh":"了解。謝謝您的幫忙。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Withdraw cash","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"提領現金","syn":"take out money = make a withdrawal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Branch ATMs","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"分行提款機","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　branch (分行/分店) + ATM (Automated Teller Machine 提款機)","trap":""},{"w":"3-dollar fee per transaction","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每筆交易 3 美元費用","syn":"charge of $3 per transfer/activity","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Monthly statement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"每月對帳單","syn":"monthly account summary = financial statement","tip":"解題技巧　對帳單通常是自動發送（emailed automatically / mailed monthly），供客戶核對所有交易明細。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：銀行客服申請結果通知語音","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明行員身分與來電目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客服人員自我介紹，並指出此留言的目的為說明「貸款與信用卡申請（loan vs credit card applications）結果」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Hello, Mr. Thompson. This is Jennifer from City Bank regarding your **recent applications**.","zh":"你好，湯普森先生。我是城市銀行的詹妮弗，關於您最近的幾項申請致電給您。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Recent applications","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"最近的申請案","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"多益常在此處設「複數申請陷阱」。主角同時申請了「貸款 (loan)」與「信用卡 (credit card)」，兩者審核進度與所需文件完全不同，不可混淆。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知貸款審核時程與核准結果","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明經理將在五個工作天內完成審核（review within 5 business days），並回報貸款已順利獲准。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The bank manager will **review your loan application** within **five business days**, and I'm pleased to **confirm approval** for your requested amount.","zh":"銀行經理將在五個工作天內審核您的貸款申請，我很榮幸能向您確認您所申請的金額已獲批准。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Review","pos":"v./n.","zh":"審查、評估","syn":"evaluate = examine = assess","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Confirm approval","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"確認批准","syn":"authorize = grant acceptance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Requested amount","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"申請金額","syn":"borrowed sum = desired funds","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明帳戶升級、手機轉帳設定與首年免手續費優惠","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"詳細介紹帳戶已升級至高級儲蓄 tier，並引導客戶使用「手機應用程式（mobile application）」進行線上轉帳與手續費豁免。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Your **savings account** has been **upgraded** to our **premium tier** with **higher interest rates**. You can **transfer money** between accounts using our **mobile application**, which I'll help you set up. There's a small fee for **withdrawing cash** from other banks' machines, but we're **waiving all fees for your first year**. Please visit our **main branch** to complete the **paperwork** and make your **initial deposit**.","zh":"您的儲蓄帳戶已升級至我們的尊榮等級，可享有更高的利率。您可以使用我們的行動應用程式（手機 App）在帳戶之間進行轉帳，我會協助您進行設定。雖然從其他銀行的提款機提款會收取少許手續費，但在您的第一年內，我們將免除所有手續費。請前往我們的總行完成文書手續，並進行首次存款。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upgraded","pos":"adj./v.","zh":"升級的","syn":"promoted = advanced","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Premium tier","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"高級會員等級、尊榮級別","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　premium (高質量的/溢價的) + tier (層級/階層)","trap":""},{"w":"Transfer money","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"轉帳、資金轉移","syn":"move funds = remit money","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Mobile application","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"手機應用程式 (App)","syn":"smartphone App = mobile platform","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Waiving all fees","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"免除、減免所有手續費","syn":"exempting all charges = eliminating all costs","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Main branch","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"總行、旗艦分行","syn":"headquarters = main office","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Paperwork","pos":"n.","zh":"文書工作、簽約手續","syn":"documentation = forms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Initial deposit","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"首次存款、開戶存入金","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　initial (最初的/開始的) + deposit (存款)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：要求額外投資證明與通知聯絡電話","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認信用卡申請仍處於「待審中（pending）」，並要求客戶補充「投資證明（investment statements）」，最後告知分機號碼。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Your **credit card application** requires **additional investment statements** for review. Check your **account balance** online anytime, and **monthly statements** will be emailed automatically. Call me at **extension 2345** to schedule your appointment.","zh":"您的信用卡申請需要額外的投資證明以供審核。您可以隨時在線上查詢您的帳戶餘額，每月的電子對帳單將會自動寄送給您。請撥打分機 2345 聯絡我，以安排您的會面時間。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Investment statements","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"投資證明、證券資產對帳單","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為貸款或信用卡審核所需的財力證明。","trap":""},{"w":"Account balance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"帳戶餘額","syn":"current funds remaining = available balance","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Extension 2345","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"分機 2345","syn":"direct line = phone extension","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，聽到 extension 代表直撥電話分機，常用於商業聯絡。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：National Trust Bank 服務升級通知信","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"t","v":"Subject: Important Updates to Your Banking Services"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布銀行服務提升計畫","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"開門見山表明為了「滿足客戶財務需求（better serve financial needs）」，宣布推出全新優化服務，為文章之核心主旨。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Valued Customer, We're enhancing our banking services to **better serve your financial needs**. —[1]—. The bank manager will **review your loan application** within **five business days** under our new expedited process.","zh":"親愛的尊榮客戶：我們正在提升我們的銀行服務，以更好地滿足您的財務需求。——[1]——。在我們全新啟用的快速流程下，銀行經理將會在五個工作天內審核您的貸款申請。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Valued Customer","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"尊榮客戶、重要客戶","syn":"loyal customer = account holder","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Enhancing","pos":"v.","zh":"提升、增強","syn":"improving = upgrading = boosting","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Expedited process","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"快速/加速流程","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　expedite (加速/促進) + process (流程/程序)。同義代換為 speedy workflow 或 faster procedure。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：介紹全新手機 App 功能與利率調整","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"詳細列出將於 11 月 1 日上線的全新功能，包含即時餘額更新、支票掃描與高利率優惠（interest rate 2.8%）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Starting **November 1st**, you can **transfer money** between accounts using our **mobile application** with **instant confirmation**. —[2]—. Enhanced features include **real-time balance updates**, **deposit check scanning**, and **investment portfolio tracking**. Interest rates on savings accounts will increase to **2.8% annually**.","zh":"從 11 月 1 日開始，您可以使用我們的行動應用程式在帳戶之間進行轉帳，並獲得即時確認。——[2]——。增強的功能包括：即時餘額更新、存款支票掃描以及投資組合追蹤。儲蓄帳戶的年利率將會提高至 2.8%。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Instant confirmation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"即時確認","syn":"immediate status update = instant notification","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Real-time","pos":"adj.","zh":"即時的、同步的","syn":"live = instant","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Deposit check scanning","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"存款支票掃描","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為數位銀行最新功能，客戶不需親自到分行，只需用手機相機掃描支票即可完成存入。","trap":""},{"w":"Investment portfolio tracking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"投資組合追蹤","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　portfolio (投資組合/代表作) + tracking (追蹤)。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：跨行提款手續費調降與延長服務時間","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"銀行降價行動（fee reduced from $5 to $2），並延長分行的貸款與信用卡專櫃服務時間（extended hours）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"There's a small fee for withdrawing cash from other banks' machines, but we're **reducing it from $5 to $2**. —[3]—. Branch services now include **extended hours** for **loan applications** and **credit card services**. Your **monthly statement** will reflect these changes beginning next month.","zh":"雖然從其他銀行的機器提領現金需要支付小額手續費，但我們正將其從 5 美元調降至 2 美元。——[3]——。分行服務現在更包括延長貸款申請和信用卡櫃台的營業時間。您的每月對帳單將會從下個月開始反映這些變更。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Reducing","pos":"v.","zh":"調降、減少","syn":"lowering = decreasing = dropping","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Extended hours","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"延長營業時間","syn":"longer operating hours = late opening","tip":"解題技巧　看到 extended hours 通常代表該機構在晚上（evenings）或週末（weekends）仍有營業。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：自動符合資格與網路銀行同意條款","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認現有客戶全部自動符合福利（automatically qualify），只需在線上或臨櫃同意條款即可完成。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"All existing account holders **automatically qualify** for our new benefits. —[4]—. Simply **approve the terms** through **online banking** or visit any branch. Investment opportunities with **guaranteed returns** are also available for qualifying customers.","zh":"所有現有的帳戶持有人都將自動符合我們全新福利的資格。——[4]——。您只需透過網路銀行同意條款，或前往任何一家分行辦理即可。我們也為符合資格的客戶提供保證回報的投資機會。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Automatically qualify","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"自動符合資格","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　automatically (自動地) + qualify (符合資格/使合格)","trap":""},{"w":"Approve the terms","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"同意條款、核准協議","syn":"accept the agreement = agree to the policy","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Online banking","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"網路銀行、線上銀行","syn":"digital banking = web-based banking","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Guaranteed returns","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"保證回報、無風險收益","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　guaranteed (有保證的/承諾的) + returns (投資報酬/收益)","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-2","title":"企業財務管理：預算與報告 (Finance Management: Budget & Reporting)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-2 財務預算場景-企業財務管理 2.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：預算審查與季度財務討論","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：詢問財務報告進度與會議時程","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"經理詢問財務報告審核進度，並提醒預算會議將在「明天早上（tomorrow morning）」召開。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Sarah, have you **finished reviewing the financial report**? The **budget meeting** is **tomorrow morning**.","zh":"莎拉，妳完成財務報告的審查了嗎？預算會議明天早上就要召開了。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Almost done. The **accounting department** needs **three more days** to complete the **annual report**, but I have the **quarterly figures** ready. Our **quarterly revenue** increased more than we originally expected.","zh":"快完成了。會計部門還需要三天才能完成年度報告，但我已經把季度數據準備好了。我們的季度收入增長超過了我們原本的預期。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Finished reviewing","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"完成審查","syn":"completed the review = done with examination","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Budget meeting","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預算會議","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益企業場景中，此會議通常需要各部門經理共同參與，審查並核准明年的費用估算。","trap":""},{"w":"Three more days","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"再三天、額外 72 小時","syn":"requires additional 72 hours","tip":"","trap":"時間錯置：預算會議是「明天早上 (tomorrow morning)」，而年度報告完成則是「三天後 (in three days)」，兩者時間跨度不同，容易出現在聽力細節題中。"},{"w":"Quarterly revenue","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"季度收入","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　quarterly (季度的，每3個月) + revenue (收入/營收，代換為 income 或 earnings)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：分析支出增加與要求核對發票","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明支出不減反增 12%（expenses increased by 12%）的任務挑戰，並要求在會前審查費用報告並核對發票。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"That's excellent news! What about expenses? Did costs decrease as we estimated?","zh":"那真是太棒的消息了！那支出呢？成本有像我們估計的那樣降低嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Unfortunately, **expenses increased by 12%**. I need to **check several invoices** for accuracy. Please review these **expense reports** before the budget meeting tomorrow.","zh":"遺憾的是，支出增加了 12%。我需要核對幾張發票的準確性。請在明天預算會議前先審查這些費用報告。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Expenses increased by 12%","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"支出增加了12%","syn":"costs grew/rose by 12 percent","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Check several invoices","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"核對、檢查幾張發票","syn":"verify bill accuracy = examine invoices","tip":"注意事項　發票 (invoice) 在多益中常與 receipt (收據) 混淆。發票是付款前的請款單，收據是付款後的憑證。","trap":""},{"w":"Expense reports","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"費用報告、報銷單","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指員工或部門提交的實際花費明細，在會前需要主管核准（approve）。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：今晚審查報告與確認付款狀態","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"男士承諾今晚審查（look at them tonight），並確認上個月的發票付款已於昨天由會計部確認處理完畢。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I'll look at them tonight. Has the payment for last month's invoice been processed?","zh":"我今晚會看。上個月發票的付款已經處理了嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, accounting confirmed it yesterday. The **profit margin** still looks healthy despite the cost increase. I'll have the complete **financial review** ready for tomorrow's presentation.","zh":"是的，會計部門昨天已經確認了。儘管成本增加了，但利潤率看起來仍然很健康。我會為明天的簡報準備好完整的財務審查報告。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Processed","pos":"v./adj.","zh":"已處理的","syn":"handled = settled = completed","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Profit margin","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"利潤率","syn":"margin of gain = profit percentage","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Financial review","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務審查","syn":"financial analysis = budget assessment","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：CFO 財務時程延期與業績更新報告","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：財務長表明身分與說明報告延遲原因","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"財務長（CFO）說明年度報告因為「發票處理延遲（invoice processing delays）」而需要再延三天（needs three more days），並分享季度營收大漲之好消息。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Good morning, everyone. This is the **CFO** with an important update about our financial reporting schedule. The accounting department needs **three more days** to complete the **annual report** due to unexpected **invoice processing delays**. However, I'm pleased to announce our **quarterly revenue** increased more than we originally expected - **up 18%** from last quarter.","zh":"大家早安。我是財務長，有一則關於我們財務報告時程的重要更新。由於非預期的發票處理延遲，會計部門需要額外三天來完成年度報告。然而，我非常高興能宣布，我們的季度營收增長超過了我們原先的預期——比上一季增長了 18%。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"CFO","pos":"n.","zh":"財務長 (Chief Financial Officer)","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　在多益聽力中，聽到 CFO 說話代表本篇獨白為高層財務廣播，主旨通常圍繞在「業績報告」或「預算政策變更」。","trap":""},{"w":"Invoice processing delays","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"發票處理延遲","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為年度報告延誤的「原因（reason）」，屬於聽力因果題的常考熱點。","trap":""},{"w":"Up 18% from last quarter","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"比上季成長 18%","syn":"18 percent growth quarter-on-quarter","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：要求會前審查費用報告並要求主管預算審批","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"要求各部門經理在明天的預算會議前審查費用報告，以核准明年的「成本估算（cost estimates）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Please review these **expense reports** before the **budget meeting** tomorrow, as we need approval for next year's **cost estimates**.","zh":"請在明天的預算會議前審查這些費用報告，因為我們需要對明年的成本估算進行審批。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Cost estimates","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"成本估算、預算評估","syn":"budget projections = expenditure forecasts","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明預算與付款時程提交要求","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"各部門主管必須在「週五（Friday）」前提交包含預算提案與付款時程之完整資料。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The financial report shows decreased expenses in marketing but increased costs in operations. All department heads must submit their **budget proposals** with **payment schedules** by **Friday**.","zh":"財務報告顯示，行銷部門的支出有所減少，但營運部門的成本增加了。所有部門主管必須在週五前提交他們的預算提案與付款時程表。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Department heads","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"部門主管","syn":"department managers = divisional supervisors","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Budget proposals","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"預算提案、預算計劃書","syn":"financial plans = allocation proposals","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Payment schedules","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"付款時程表","syn":"payment timelines = disbursement plans","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：強勁利潤率與正向增長展望","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"總結指出利潤率依然強勁，年報呈現正向成長趨勢，要求各部門在提交資料中同時列出收入與支出預估。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Our **profit margins** remain strong, and the **annual review** indicates **positive growth trends**. Remember to include both **revenue projections** and **expense estimates** in your submissions.","zh":"我們的利潤率依保持強勁，且年度審查呈現正向的成長趨勢。請記住，在您提交的材料中，必須同時包含營收預測與支出估算。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Positive growth trends","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"正向成長趨勢","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　positive (正向的/積極的) + growth (成長) + trends (趨勢/走向)","trap":""},{"w":"Revenue projections","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"營收預測、收入預估","syn":"income forecasts = sales projections","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：CFO 季度財務審查與預算規劃備忘錄","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"t","v":"MEMORANDUM"},{"k":"l","v":"To: All Department Managers"},{"k":"l","v":"From: Jennifer Liu, Chief Financial Officer"},{"k":"l","v":"Date: September 15"},{"k":"l","v":"Subject: Q3 Financial Review and Budget Planning"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：分享第三季業績與收入遠超預估","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布第三季強勁的營收表現：實際收入達到 420 萬美元，遠超原先估計的 380 萬美元（$4.2 million actual vs $3.8 million estimate）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Team, I'm writing to share our third-quarter results and outline the upcoming budget process. I'll begin by reviewing our revenue performance. —[1]—. Our **quarterly revenue** increased more than we originally expected, reaching **$4.2 million versus our estimate of $3.8 million**.","zh":"親愛的團隊夥伴們：我寫信是要與大家分享我們第三季的業績，並概述即將進行的預算流程。我將首先審查我們的營收表現。——[1]——。我們的季度收入增長超過了我們原先的預期，達到了 420 萬美元，而我們原先的預估值為 380 萬美元。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"$4.2 million versus our estimate of $3.8 million","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"420萬美元對比原先估算之380萬美元","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧（數據對比）　多益閱讀必考「實際 vs 預估」的數據細節。實際值為 420 萬美元，估算值為 380 萬美元，實際比估計多出 40 萬美元。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：年報因處理發票而延期三天，分析支出變動","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"年報需要再三天完成，並指出當前發票顯示行政支出減少、生產成本增加，利潤仍高於預測 15%（15% above projections）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The accounting department needs **three more days** to complete the **annual report**, which will provide comprehensive cost analysis. —[2]—. Current invoices show expenses decreased in administrative areas but increased in production. Overall profit remains **15% above projections**.","zh":"會計部門還需要三天來完成年度報告，該報告將會提供全面的成本分析。——[2]——。目前的發票顯示，行政領域的支出有所減少，但生產成本增加了。整體利潤仍高於預測的 15%。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"15% above projections","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"高於預估 15%","syn":"surpassed projections by 15 percent = 15% more than forecast","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：預算會議時間、部門資料提交與共享雲端範本","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"要求主管在明天上午 10 點的預算會議前審查報告，並至共享雲端（shared drive）下載範本準備明年的時程預算。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Please review these **expense reports** before the **budget meeting** tomorrow at **10 AM**. —[3]—. Each department must provide detailed **payment schedules** and **quarterly estimates** for the next fiscal year. The financial report template is available on our **shared drive**.","zh":"請在明天上午 10 點的預算會議前審查這些費用報告。——[3]——。每個部門必須為下一個會計年度提供詳細的付款時程表和季度估算。財務報告範本可以在我們的共享雲端硬碟上取得。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Budget meeting tomorrow at 10 AM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"明天上午 10 點預算會議","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　此為「立即性任務」的時間點，要與年報的三天、以及最終提交截止日期進行時間區隔。","trap":""},{"w":"Shared drive","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"共享雲端、共同磁碟","syn":"common server = cloud drive = shared repository","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：預算提案九月底截止日期與情境分析要求","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"規定最終預算提案必須在「9 月 30 日前（by September 30th）」提交，且必須包含增加與減少的多重情境分析。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Annual planning requires careful review of all revenue streams and costs. —[4]—. Submit your final budget proposals by **September 30th**, including both increase and decrease scenarios for various market conditions.","zh":"年度規劃需要對所有收入來源和成本進行仔細審查。——[4]——。請在 9 月 30 日前提交您的最終預算提案，包括針對不同市場狀況的支出增加與減少的情境分析。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"September 30th","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"九月三十日","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧（截止日期）　預算提交的最終期限（deadline / cutoff date）為 9 月 30 日。","trap":""},{"w":"Increase and decrease scenarios","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"增長與衰退之情境分析","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　scenario (情境/方案/腳本)。此要求是為了年度預防性財務管理。","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-3","title":"付款與資金流：帳單與交易 (Payment & Cash Flow: Billing & Transactions)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-3 付款與資金流：帳單與交易.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：帳單疑慮與預付折扣討論","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：客戶對帳單金額高於報價提出疑問","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶詢問帳單問題：總金額高於原本的報價（total seems higher than original price quoted）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Excuse me, I'd like to **inquire about this bill**. The total seems **higher than the original price quoted**.","zh":"不好意思，我想詢問一下這張帳單。總金額似乎比當初報價的還要高。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Let me check your receipt. I see there's a **charge for expedited service** and **tax was added**. The payment for last month's services is **due by the fifteenth**.","zh":"讓我幫您看一下收據。我看到裡面有一筆加急服務的收費，並且加上了稅金。上個月服務的付款截止日是十五號。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Inquire about this bill","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"詢問這張帳單","syn":"ask about the invoice = question the billing statement","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Higher than the original price quoted","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"高於原先報價","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"金額混淆：多益極常烤「原價（original quote）不含稅與服務費」與「最終總額（final total）含稅」的時間/金額混淆，本題就是因為加急費（expedited service）與稅金（tax）才變貴的。"},{"w":"Due by the fifteenth","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"十五號前到期/截止","syn":"must be paid no later than the 15th","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：詢問折扣優惠方案","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"客戶因額外費用感到驚訝，主動詢問是否有折扣（discount）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"I wasn't aware of the additional charges. Is there any **discount** available? I've been a customer for three years.","zh":"我並不知道有這些額外的費用。請問有任何折扣可以使用嗎？我已經是三年的老客戶了。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Discount","pos":"n.","zh":"折扣、優惠","syn":"price reduction = special offer = markdown","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明預付折扣與免手續費條件","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提供兩大優惠行動：預付享九折（10% discount for orders paid in advance），或付現/支票免交易手續費（waive transaction fee）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"We can offer a **ten percent discount** for **orders paid in advance**. Also, if you pay by check or cash today, I can **waive the transaction fee**.","zh":"如果是預付訂單，我們可以提供百分之十的折扣。此外，如果您今天用支票或現金付款，我可以幫您免除交易手續費。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Orders paid in advance","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預付訂單","syn":"prepaid orders = prepayments","tip":"解題技巧（優惠條件）　只有預付（paid in advance）才能享有九折！一般常規付款（regular payment）是沒有九折的。","trap":""},{"w":"Waive the transaction fee","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"免除交易手續費","syn":"eliminate the service charge = free of transaction fee","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：確認退款時程與銷售撤銷手續","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認退款處理時間為 7 到 10 天內（within seven to ten days），要求帶收據辦理銷售撤銷。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"What if I need a **refund** later? I might cancel part of my purchase.","zh":"如果我之後需要退款怎麼辦？我可能會取消部分購買。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Your refund will be **processed within seven to ten days**. Just bring your **receipt** and we'll handle the **sale reversal**. The due date for payment remains the same regardless.","zh":"您的退款將會在七到十天內處理完成。您只需帶上收據，我們就會為您辦理銷售撤銷手續。不過，無論如何付款到期日都保持不變。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Refund","pos":"n./v.","zh":"退款","syn":"reimbursement = repayment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Processed within seven to ten days","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在 7 到 10 天內處理完成","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間誤判：退款到帳需要 7-10 天，而付款截止是在 15 號前，題目常將兩個時間混淆設陷。"},{"w":"Receipt","pos":"n.","zh":"收據、發票","syn":"proof of purchase = transaction record","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Sale reversal","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"銷售撤銷、退貨退款程序","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　sale (銷售) + reversal (反轉/逆轉)。代換為 transaction cancellation。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：店內付款政策與折扣變更廣播","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：宣布付款政策變更與生效時間","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"宣布全新付款政策，明確指出變更將自「下週一（next Monday）」起生效。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Attention customers, this is an important announcement about our **new payment policies**. Starting **next Monday**, we're updating our billing system to serve you better.","zh":"各位顧客請注意，這是一則關於我們全新付款政策的重要公告。自下週一開始，我們將升級我們的計費系統，以更好地為您服務。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Starting next Monday","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自下週一開始","syn":"effective next Monday = commencing next week","tip":"解題技巧　在多益廣播中，新政策的「生效日期（effective date）」是必抓的關鍵考點。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：統一每月付款截止日與收據總額說明","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"規定所有帳單付款到期日皆為「15 號（due by the fifteenth）」，並提醒收據上的總額已包含所有稅金。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The payment for last month's services is **due by the fifteenth**, and all future bills will have the same monthly due date. Please note that prices shown **include all charges and tax**, so your **receipt** will match the total displayed.","zh":"上個月服務的付款截至日期為十五號，未來所有帳單都將採用相同的每月到期日。請注意，所顯示的價格已包含所有費用與稅金，因此您的收據金額將會與顯示的總額一致。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Due by the fifteenth","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在十五號前截止","syn":"deadline is the 15th = must settle before the 15th","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Include all charges and tax","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"包含所有費用與稅金","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"金額混淆：新系統下「所見即所得」，總額已含稅（tax included），不會再有額外隱藏費用（no surprise charges）。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：說明預付折扣與免手續費條件，提醒保留收據","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"行動方案：任何付款方式預付皆可享九折（10% discount for orders paid in advance），免除大部分手續費，但保留信用卡 2% 手續費。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"We can offer a **ten percent discount** for **orders paid in advance**, whether by cash, check, or card. For any purchase requiring a **refund**, your refund will be **processed within seven to ten days**. Transaction fees for credit cards **remain at 2%**, but we're **eliminating fees** for other payment methods.","zh":"不論是使用現金、支票還是信用卡，預付訂單我們皆可提供百分之十的折扣。對於任何需要退款的購買，您的退款將會在七到十天內處理。信用卡的交易手續費仍保持 2%，但我們正取消其他付款方式的手續費。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Ten percent discount","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"九折、10% 折扣","syn":"10% price reduction","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Eliminating fees","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"取消、消除費用","syn":"removing charges = waiving fees","tip":"","trap":"費用項目保留：雖然取消了其他付款手續費，但信用卡 2% 手續費仍然保留（credit card 2% remains），此為細節是非題的地雷。"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：收據保留提醒與客務櫃台諮詢","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認售後服務：要求顧客必須「保留所有收據（keep all receipts）」以供未來保固或調整，若有疑問可至客服櫃台。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Remember to **keep all receipts** for warranty claims and potential **sale adjustments**. Visit our **customer service desk** for questions about your bill or payment options.","zh":"請記住保留所有收據，以供保固申請和潛在的銷售調整之用。若對您的帳單或付款方式有任何疑問，請前往我們的客戶服務櫃台。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Keep all receipts","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"保留所有收據","syn":"retain proof of purchase = preserve transaction documents","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Sale adjustments","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"銷售調整、退換貨/價格調整","syn":"price adjustments = return and exchange process","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Customer service desk","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"客戶服務櫃台","syn":"information counter = help desk","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：Citywide Utilities 帳單系統升級與付款須知","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"t","v":"CITYWIDE UTILITIES"},{"k":"l","v":"Date: June 1"},{"k":"l","v":"Subject: Important Billing Update"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：通知實施全新帳單與付款規定","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"通知帳戶持有人全新的付款與帳管程序「即刻生效（effective immediately）」，並規定上月帳款於 15 號截止。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Valued Customer, We're writing to inform you about changes to our payment and billing procedures **effective immediately**. —[1]—. The payment for last month's services is **due by the fifteenth**, establishing a consistent due date for all accounts.","zh":"親愛的尊榮客戶：我們寫信是要通知您，我們的付款和計費程序有所變更，且即刻生效。——[1]——。上個月服務的付款截止日期為十五號，這將為所有帳戶建立一個一致的到期日。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Effective immediately","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"即刻生效","syn":"taking effect right now = active from today","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Consistent due date","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"一致、統一的到期日","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　consistent (一致的/始終如一的) + due date (到期日/截止日)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：預付款享九折優惠，總額含稅說明","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"說明為了幫助管理成本，預付款（prepayment）可享 10% 折扣，收據上的總價格已包含所有收費與稅金。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"To help manage costs, we can offer a **ten percent discount** for **orders paid in advance**. —[2]—. This applies to customers who pay their bill before receiving service, whether paying by cash, check, or electronic transfer. The total price **includes all charges and applicable tax**, clearly shown on your **receipt**.","zh":"為了協助管理成本，我們針對預付訂單提供百分之十的折扣。——[2]——。這適用於在接受服務前即付清帳單的客戶，不論是使用現金、支票還是電子轉帳付款。總價格已包含所有費用與適用稅金，並會清楚地顯示在您的收據上。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Pay their bill before receiving service","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"在接受服務前付款","syn":"paid in advance = prepayment","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Electronic transfer","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"電子轉帳","syn":"digital payment = online wire transfer","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：多付款項之退款時程與逾期滯納金罰則","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"提出多付或取消之退款行動：7-10 天內退還。並規定未於 15 號前付款者，每月將加收 1.5% 滯納金（late charge 1.5% monthly）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"If you overpay or cancel services, your refund will be **processed within seven to ten days**. —[3]—. Please retain all transaction documents and receipts for your records. Bills not paid by the due date will incur a **late charge of 1.5% monthly**.","zh":"如果您多付了款項或取消服務，您的退款將會在七到十天內處理。——[3]——。請保留所有交易文件和收據以作記錄。未在到期日之前付清的帳單，每月將會產生 1.5% 的滯納金。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Overpay","pos":"v.","zh":"多付款項","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　over- (超過) + pay (付款)","trap":""},{"w":"Incur a late charge of 1.5% monthly","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"產生每月 1.5% 的滯納金","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　incur (招致/產生費用) + late charge (滯納金/逾期罰款)。多益代換為 overdue penalty。","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：推出預付套餐與聯絡計費部門","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認新功能：推出預付套餐（prepaid service packages）提供額外省錢，有問題可洽詢計費部門（billing department）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"New payment options include automatic deduction and online purchase through our website. —[4]—. The **sale of prepaid service packages** offers additional savings beyond the standard discount. Contact our **billing department** for questions about your account or payment arrangements.","zh":"新的付款方式包括自動扣款以及透過我們網站進行線上購買。——[4]——。預付服務套餐的銷售更提供了標準折扣之外的額外優惠。若對您的帳戶或付款安排有任何疑問，請聯絡我們的計費部門。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Automatic deduction","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"自動扣款","syn":"auto-pay = automatic debit","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Prepaid service packages","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"預付服務套餐","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指預先購買多次或整套服務，通常比單次購買更加便宜（additional savings）。","trap":""},{"w":"Billing department","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"計費部門、帳務組","syn":"accounts department = financial services team","tip":"","trap":""}]}]},{"code":"15-4","title":"財務專業服務：諮詢與提案 (Financial Professional Services: Consulting & Proposals)","ch":"Chapter 15　財務與預算","sec":"四大情境單元（Ch15-1 ～ Ch15-4）","items":[{"k":"lead","t":"本單元收錄《Ch15-4 財務專業服務-諮詢與提案.pdf》全部英文原文，依 Part 3 簡短對話／Part 4 簡短獨白／Part 7 閱讀理解 分類，並以 STAR（Situation 情境確認・Task 任務說明・Action 行動方案・Result 結果確認）四段拆解。畫面預設只顯示英文原句，點任一句可展開該句解析，右上角「🔍 全面解析」可一次展開全部中譯、字彙、同義代換與防雷陷阱。"},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 3 簡短對話：投資提案與合約簽署會議","ic":"🎙️"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：了解客戶財務狀況與投資選項","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"財務顧問在今天的會議中，向客戶 Mr. Chen 提出「三種不同的投資選擇（three different investment options）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Good morning, Mr. Chen. The **financial consultant** will present **three different investment options** during today's meeting.","zh":"早上好，陳先生。財務顧問將在今天的會議上提出三種不同的投資選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Financial consultant","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務顧問","syn":"financial advisor = wealth specialist = financial expert","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Three different investment options","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"三種不同的投資選擇","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　investment (投資) + options (選項/選擇，代換為 choices 或 proposals)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：合約簽署確認與提案前置要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認合約（contract / service agreement）是否已由客戶簽署，因為這是進行下一步提案的「前提（prerequisite）」。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Excellent. Did the client **sign the service agreement** yet? We need that **contract** before we can proceed with the **proposal**.","zh":"太好了。客戶簽署服務協議了嗎？在我們進行提案之前，我們需要那份合約。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Sign the service agreement","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"簽署服務協議","syn":"execute the contract = authorize the service terms","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Contract","pos":"n.","zh":"合約、協議","syn":"agreement = deal = legal document","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Proceed with the proposal","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"繼續進行提案","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　proceed (繼續/進行) + proposal (提案/計劃書，代換為 plan 或 suggestion)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：歸檔文件與四月稅務截止期限提醒","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"回報今早已收到簽署文件，並提醒所有稅務文件必須在「四月截止日期（April deadline）」前提交，目前進度在計劃內。"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Yes, I received the **signed documents** this morning. All **tax documents** must be submitted **before the April deadline**, so we're on track. I've already **filed the necessary records**.","zh":"是的，我今天早上收到了簽署的文件。所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日期前提交，所以我們目前進度在計劃中。我已經歸檔了必要的記錄。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Tax documents","pos":"n. pl.","zh":"稅務文件","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　指申報所得稅（tax compliance）所需之表單。","trap":""},{"w":"Before the April deadline","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在四月截止日之前","syn":"no later than April = prior to the April cutoff","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"On track","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"在計劃中、符合預期進度","syn":"on schedule = following the plan","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Filed the necessary records","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"歸檔必要的記錄","syn":"organized paperwork = stored documentation","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：安排下週會面與簡報材料準備","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"確認後續安排：已排定「下週二下午（next Tuesday afternoon）」與顧問開會，並交代在「週一（Monday）」前準備好所有簡報檔案。"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Perfect. We've **scheduled a meeting with the advisor** for **next Tuesday afternoon** to review everything. Can you prepare the **presentation materials**?","zh":"太完美了。我們已經安排在下週二下午與顧問會面，以審查所有事情。妳能準備一下簡報材料嗎？"},{"k":"en","sp":"W (Woman)","t":"Of course. I'll have all **files ready by Monday**. Should I also submit the initial proposal to the client before the deadline?","zh":"當然可以。我會在週一前準備好所有檔案。我是否也應該在截止日期前，將初步提案提交給客戶？"},{"k":"en","sp":"M (Man)","t":"Yes, please. Make sure to include our **standard service terms** in the **contract documentation**.","zh":"是的，麻煩妳了。請務必在合約文件中，包含我們的標準服務條款。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Scheduled a meeting with the advisor","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"安排與顧問會面","syn":"arranged a session with the specialist","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Next Tuesday afternoon","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"下週二下午","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"時間混淆：與顧問的定案審查會議是「下週二下午」，而稅務文件提交截止則在「四月（April）」，切勿張冠李戴。"},{"w":"Presentation materials","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"簡報材料、會議檔案","syn":"briefing files = demonstration records","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Standard service terms","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"標準服務條款","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　standard (標準的/常規的) + service (服務) + terms (條款/條件)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 4 簡短獨白：Premier Financial 諮詢會面前通報","ic":"📢"},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：表明顧問身分與來電目的","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"財務長/理財顧問 David Park 致電提醒客戶「明天下午 2 點（tomorrow at 2 PM）」將召開投資簡報會議。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Hello, this is David Park from Premier Financial Services calling about your **upcoming consultation**.","zh":"您好，我是尊榮財務服務的大衛·帕克，關於您即將進行的諮詢致電給您。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Upcoming consultation","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"即將進行的諮詢","syn":"approaching advisory session = forthcoming meeting","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：告知簡報內容與攜帶文件要求","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"顧問將提出三種投資選擇，並要求客戶親自攜帶所有「相關文件與記錄（relevant documents and records）」供現場審查。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"The **financial consultant** will present **three different investment options** when we meet **tomorrow at 2 PM**. Please bring all **relevant documents and records** for review.","zh":"當我們明天下午 2 點會面時，財務顧問將會提出三種不同的投資選擇。請攜帶所有相關的文件和記錄以供審查。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Tomorrow at 2 PM","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"明天下午 2 點","syn":"","tip":"解題技巧　此為初次「簡報會議（Presentation meeting）」的時間。","trap":""},{"w":"Relevant documents and records","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"相關文件與記錄","syn":"associated paperwork and financial files","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：提醒稅務截止日期與定案會議安排","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"稅務提交僅剩兩週（just two weeks away），並已排定「下週二下午（next Tuesday afternoon）」與顧問開會，以完成合約。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"All **tax documents** must be submitted **before the April deadline**, which is **just two weeks away**. We've scheduled a meeting with the advisor for **next Tuesday afternoon** to **finalize your service agreement**.","zh":"所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日期前提交，這距離現在只有兩週的時間。我們已經安排在下週二下午與顧問會面，以定案您的服務協議。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Just two weeks away","pos":"adj. phr.","zh":"僅剩兩週、十四天內","syn":"within 14 days = fortnight later","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Finalize your service agreement","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"定案您的服務協議","syn":"complete the service contract = approve the final agreement","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：說明服務範圍與多元提交管道","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"提案包含全面規劃與持續支援，合約需簽名才能開始，並說明可透過「客戶入口網站（client portal）」或親自攜帶（bring them）提交。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Speaker","t":"Our proposal includes comprehensive **financial planning** and **ongoing support**. The **contract requires your signature** before we can begin managing your accounts. Please file any **additional paperwork** with our office by **this Friday's deadline**. You can submit documents through our **secure client portal** or bring them to tomorrow's presentation. Contact me if you need to **reschedule** this important meeting.","zh":"我們的提案包含了全面的財務規劃與持續的支援。在我們開始管理您的帳戶之前，合約需要您的親筆簽名。請在本週五的截止日期前，將任何額外的文書資料歸檔至我們的辦公室。您可以透過我們的安全客戶入口網站提交文件，或者直接帶到明天的簡報會議上。如果您需要重新安排這場重要的會議，請與我聯絡。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Financial planning","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務規劃","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　financial (財務的) + planning (規劃)","trap":""},{"w":"Ongoing support","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"持續支援","syn":"continuous assistance = unlimited client support","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Contract requires your signature","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"合約需要您的簽名","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　在合規流程中，「簽名（signature）」是服務正式啟動的絕對前置條件。","trap":""},{"w":"Secure client portal","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"安全客戶入口網站/傳輸端口","syn":"client secure webpage = online document portal","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Reschedule","pos":"v.","zh":"重新安排時間、改期","syn":"rearrange the session = change meeting time","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h1","t":"Part 7 閱讀理解：Excellent Financial 季度審查與投資提案電郵","ic":"✉️"},{"k":"doc","v":[{"k":"l","v":"To: Jennifer Williams (jwilliams@techcorp.com)"},{"k":"l","v":"From: Robert Lee (rlee@excellentfinancial.com)"},{"k":"l","v":"Date: March 15"},{"k":"l","v":"Subject: Quarterly Financial Review Proposal"}]},{"k":"h2","t":"S - Situation","d":"情境確認：感謝客戶選擇並預告投資簡報","ic":"🔴"},{"k":"tip","t":"寫信感謝客戶選擇 Excellent Financial 作為「企業顧問（corporate advisor）」，並預告顧問將提出三種量身打造的投資選擇。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Dear Ms. Williams, Thank you for selecting Excellent Financial as your **corporate advisor**. —[1]—. The **financial consultant** will present **three different investment options** tailored to your company's growth objectives.","zh":"親愛的威廉士女士：感謝您選擇 Excellent Financial 作為您公司的顧問。——[1]——。財務顧問將會提出三種專為貴公司增長目標量身打造的投資選擇。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Corporate advisor","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"企業顧問","syn":"company specialist/advisor = business consultant [10, 11]","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Growth objectives","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"增長目標","syn":"expansion goals = development targets","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"T - Task","d":"任務說明：明確服務範圍與四月合規截止日期","ic":"📋"},{"k":"tip","t":"服務協議概述諮詢業務範圍（consulting engagement），並重申所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日前提交以確保合規（ensure compliance）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"Our **service agreement** outlines the scope of our **consulting engagement**. —[2]—. All **tax documents** must be submitted **before the April deadline** to **ensure compliance**. Our team will **file all necessary records** and maintain complete **documentation** throughout our contract period.","zh":"我們的服務協議概述了我們諮詢業務的範圍。——[2]——。所有稅務文件必須在四月截止日期前提交，以確保符合法規。在我們的合約期間內，我們的團隊將歸檔所有必要的記錄並保持完整的文檔。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Consulting engagement","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"諮詢業務、顧問合約","syn":"advisory contract = consulting services","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Ensure compliance","pos":"v. phr.","zh":"確保合規、遵循法規","syn":"","tip":"詞彙拆解　ensure (確保) + compliance (遵守/遵循法規)","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"A - Action","d":"行動方案：安排在客戶辦公室會面與審查準備","ic":"💡"},{"k":"tip","t":"行動方案：排定「下週二下午」在「客戶的辦公室（at your offices）」開會簡報，並要求客戶準備好所有財務記錄。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"We've scheduled a meeting with the advisor for **next Tuesday afternoon** at **your offices**. —[3]—. The presentation will cover **quarterly projections**, and our consultant will **review all documents** you've provided. Please have your **financial records** available for this meeting.","zh":"我們已經安排在下週二下午於您的辦公室與顧問會面。——[3]——。簡報內容將會涵蓋季度預測，而我們的顧問將會審查您所提供的所有文件。請在本次會議中準備好您的財務記錄。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"At your offices","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"於您的辦公室","syn":"","tip":"","trap":"開會的地點是在客戶 Jennifer Williams 的辦公室 (your offices)，絕對不是顧問 Robert Lee 所在的 Excellent Financial 辦公室！"},{"w":"Quarterly projections","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"季度預測","syn":"three-month forecasts = quarterly estimates","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Financial records","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"財務記錄","syn":"fiscal files = financial books = accounting records","tip":"","trap":""}]},{"k":"h2","t":"R - Result","d":"結果確認：承諾無限客戶支援與簽約截止日期警告","ic":"✅"},{"k":"tip","t":"合約提供每月審查與無限客戶支援（unlimited client support），並強調簽約截止日為 3 月 31 日（deadline for signing March 31st）。"},{"k":"en","sp":"Text","t":"The proposal includes monthly reviews and **unlimited client support**. —[4]—. Submit any questions before our scheduled meeting so we can address them in the presentation. The service contract is attached for your review, with the **deadline for signing** set for **March 31st**.","zh":"本提案包含了每月審查以及無限的客戶支援。——[4]——。請在我們排定的會議前提交任何問題，以便我們在簡報中進行解答。服務合約已附在信後供您審閱，簽約截止日期定為 3 月 31 日。"},{"k":"voc","v":[{"w":"Unlimited client support","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"無限制、無限次的客戶支援","syn":"continuous client assistance = around-the-clock support","tip":"","trap":""},{"w":"Deadline for signing","pos":"n. phr.","zh":"簽約截止日期","syn":"","tip":"注意事項　3 月 31 日為「簽署合約」的最後期限，而「四月 (April)」則是稅務申報文件提交的截止期限。","trap":""}]}]}];